+## Routes
+
+All existing routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales`: JSON `{ "csv": "..." }`, with columns
+  `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. `soldAt` is an ISO instant with a timezone;
+  `qty` is a positive whole number of portions. Returns `{ "tickets": 2,
+  "dishes": 5 }`, counting new tickets and total portions imported. All rows
+  are validated, including rows for previously imported tickets; those tickets
+  are skipped. Invalid CSV, invalid rows and insufficient stock return
+  `bad_request` naming the physical CSV row (first data row is row 2).
+  The whole file is atomic. Consumption uses the sale instant and ref
+  `sale:<ticket>`.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD`: returns an array of
+  `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }`, sorted by item id, for items
+  with positive theoretical or actual use. Days are inclusive in UTC.
+  Theoretical use is the ingredient quantity saved with each sale; actual
+  use includes every consume movement. Difference is actual minus theoretical.
