+## Sales (schema 3)
+
+Schema 2 migrates to schema 3 by adding an empty `sales` collection and a
+`sale` sequence, preserving existing records. Each sale row has an id,
+`ticket`, UTC `soldAt`, `dishId`, portion `qty`, and a snapshot of scaled
+`ingredients` (`itemId`, `qty`). Recipe edits cannot change historical use.
+Tickets present before an import are skipped; multiple rows for a new ticket
+are imported together. File imports commit sales, batches, movements and
+sequences together only after every row succeeds.
